	(text "Packaging (metric | imperial)\n\n  - Resistors\n	- RP2040		--> 1005 | 0402\n	- USB data 		--> 1005 | 0402\n	- I2C puller	--> 1005 | 0402\n	- Others		--> 1608 | 0603\n\n  - Capacitors\n	- RP2040		--> 1005 | 0402\n	- Others		--> 1608 | 0603\n\n  - Diodes\n	- Switches		--> SOD-123\n	- TVS			--> SOD-523\n\n  - Transistors\n	- ESD			--> SOT-723"
